## Healthcheck Pinger

A minimal container that `curl`s a URL every 5 minutes to signal uptime to an
external monitor (e.g. UptimeRobot, Healthchecks.io). Useful for getting alerted
when the stack goes down without having to poll the server yourself.

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Ping URL | `{{HEALTHCHECK_URL}}` |
| Interval | every 5 minutes |

